        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko rāba, nzohamagara imiryango yose yo mu bihugu vy’abami b’i burārūko, ni jewe Uhoraho mbivuze; bazoza, umuntu wese ashinge intebe yiwe y’ubgami mw ishikiro ku marembo y’i Yerusalemu, ahaherereye ku nzitiro zaho zose zihazitiriye, n’ahaherereye ku bisagara vyose vy’i Buyuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.15"
            ]
