              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko rāba, uyu musi nguhinduye igisagara cubakiwe inzitiro, nguhinduye n’inkingi y’icuma n’inzitiro z’imiringa, bitazotsindwa n’igihugu cose, canke n’abami b’i Buyuda, canke n’abaganwa baho, canke n’abaherezi baho, canke n’abantu bo mu gihugu. ",
          "type": "text",
